# Binaries for programs and plugins.
#
# Anchored: a bare "arex" matches any path component with that name, which
# silently ignored the whole charts/arex directory.
/arex
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test
*.out

# env and config file
.env
config.json
config.yaml

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
.vscode/
.claude/

# goreleaser releases
dist/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# graphify knowledge graph output
graphify-out/
